WEBVTT

00:06:29.279 --> 00:06:34.306
Hvala, želim vam mir in blagoslov.

00:06:34.312 --> 00:06:39.944
(Aplavz)

00:06:39.944 --> 00:06:42.715
Hvala.
(Aplavz)

00:06:42.715 --> 00:06:46.015
Pat Mitchell: Torej,
Mayo ste slišali govoriti o

00:06:46.015 --> 00:06:48.838
neverjetnih starših, ki stojijo ob strani

00:06:48.838 --> 00:06:51.055
tej neverjetni ženski. Kje sta?

00:06:51.055 --> 00:06:54.053
Prosim, gospod in gospa Penn.
Bi Vas lahko prosila -- Aha!

00:06:54.053 --> 00:06:57.807
(Aplavz)